							"content:textarea:2:27": {
								"icon": "align-justify",
								"name": "Paragraph",
								"type": "textarea",
								"html": "<p>\n\tThe Salvation Army is fortunate to have the support of the Wake County community. Without your support, we would not have the resources to accomplish our work. Each year over 1,500 children come through our community center&nbsp;doors because of people like you who support our cause and believe in our mission. Our instructional athletic program focuses on teaching the importance of team play and good sportsmanship. With no tryouts, all youth can participate&nbsp;in soccer, basketball, baseball, flag football, and T-ball.\n</p>",
